- Normalizes missing scheme by adding http://.
- Fetches the URL with a user-agent and timeout.
- Verifies an HTML response.
- Extracts title from OpenGraph meta, Twitter meta, <title>, or first <h1>.
- Returns a dictionary: {'ok': True, 'title': '...'} on success or {'ok': False, 'error': '...'} on failure.

